2562
02:18:14,140 --> 02:18:14,660
Got it!

2563
02:18:17,300 --> 02:18:17,740
Uh...

2564
02:18:17,740 --> 02:18:18,280
What is that?

2565
02:18:22,190 --> 02:18:22,810
Is that a bush?

2566
02:18:24,170 --> 02:18:25,290
