2573
02:18:46,280 --> 02:18:47,160
Okay, new rule.

2574
02:18:48,240 --> 02:18:49,140
We're gonna find...

2575
02:18:51,120 --> 02:18:52,020
No more new rules.

2576
02:18:52,580 --> 02:18:53,440
We're gonna have too many rules.

2577
02:18:55,500 --> 02:18:56,420
Let's just play safe.

2578
02:18:57,600 --> 02:18:58,900
And there's a big guy right there.

2579
02:19:00,640 --> 02:19:00,960
That's...

2580
02:19:01,580 --> 02:19:02,220
Perfect shot!

2581
02:19:03,380 --> 02:19:03,880
Fuck yeah!

2582
02:19:04,820 --> 02:19:05,720
