2591
02:19:21,540 --> 02:19:22,060
Get rid of it.

2592
02:19:23,500 --> 02:19:23,740
Burn!

2593
02:19:29,450 --> 02:19:30,450
A wand right there!

2594
02:19:30,530 --> 02:19:32,270
