Empty potion?

2600
02:19:45,910 --> 02:19:46,250
Wow!

2601
02:19:48,130 --> 02:19:49,410
That's the first time I've seen that.

2602
02:19:57,800 --> 02:19:58,160
Nice!

2603
02:19:58,860 --> 02:19:59,440
That's good!

2604
02:20:00,820 --> 02:20:01,380
Much better.

2605
