I keep thinking this guy's alive.

2646
02:22:12,500 --> 02:22:14,200
We gotta murder him even more.

2647
02:22:14,420 --> 02:22:14,760
There we go.

2648
02:22:18,130 --> 02:22:18,470
Alright.

2649
