You know, but I just need to have a good start here.

2652
02:22:29,930 --> 02:22:30,950
That's what it's all about.

2653
02:22:32,010 --> 02:22:33,090
Yeah, go this way first.

2654
02:22:35,110 --> 02:22:36,510
Let me keep up here.

2655
02:22:38,410 --> 02:22:39,370
And there's nothing.

2656
02:22:39,630 --> 02:22:39,690
Good.

2657
02:22:41,670 --> 02:22:44,430
I think this is the... yep, lava place.

2658
02:22:45,570 --> 02:22:46,050
Sick shot.

2659
02:22:47,650 --> 02:22:48,690
