91 gold only.

2666
02:23:20,830 --> 02:23:21,790
We need more for sure.

2667
02:23:27,940 --> 02:23:29,160
Give me lots of Bloodstains.

2668
02:23:30,040 --> 02:23:30,520
Give me that crit.

2669
02:23:34,300 --> 02:23:34,560
Invis.

2670
02:23:37,000 --> 02:23:37,400
Cool.

2671
02:23:38,700 --> 02:23:39,180
What's that?

2672
02:23:40,480 --> 02:23:40,920
Polymorphine.

2673
02:23:42,580 --> 02:23:43,540
I think I just crit him.

2674
02:23:51,840 --> 02:23:52,160
Nice.

2675
02:23:53,380 --> 02:23:55,420
I'm playing well so far in this run here.

2676
02:24:01,730 --> 02:24:02,370
Oh, that was sick.

2677
02:24:09,800 --> 02:24:10,280
Nice.

2678
02:24:13,080 --> 02:24:13,880
Another portal there.

2679
