It's good to know.

2680
02:24:16,980 --> 02:24:19,060
Also, I do have 10 TNTs left.

2681
02:24:20,000 --> 02:24:21,800
So I can potentially get in anywhere.

2682
02:24:23,300 --> 02:24:23,920
Almost anywhere.

2683
