You know what?

2685
02:24:26,440 --> 02:24:27,700
Pheromone is actually not bad.

2686
02:24:29,540 --> 02:24:33,180
Because you can put it on the enemies, and they will become your friends.

2687
02:24:36,680 --> 02:24:37,640
Ah, no!

2688
02:24:40,540 --> 02:24:42,480
I panic when these guys get too close.

2689
02:24:49,180 --> 02:24:50,040
There we go.

2690
02:24:51,200 --> 02:24:51,880
Only lost 7 HP.

2691
02:24:52,220 --> 02:24:52,780
It's not too bad.

2692
02:24:55,740 --> 02:24:57,020
I wonder if I can pheromone the boss.

2693
02:24:59,080 --> 02:24:59,900
Make him my friend.

2694
02:25:04,000 --> 02:25:05,080
That would be pretty cool.

2695
02:25:08,170 --> 02:25:08,890
What do we have up here?

2696
02:25:13,860 --> 02:25:14,840
It's that thing again.

2697
02:25:15,520 --> 02:25:16,040
Oh, you know what?

2698
02:25:16,100 --> 02:25:16,720
I'm taking it.

2699
02:25:17,620 --> 02:25:18,040
I'm taking it.

2700
02:25:24,840 --> 02:25:25,240
Yes.

2701
02:25:25,240 --> 02:25:29,280
I'm going to put this rock on the altar near the boss.

2702
02:25:30,340 --> 02:25:32,580
And if that doesn't do anything, I'm going to throw it in the boss's face.

2703
02:25:34,820 --> 02:25:35,760
See what happens then.

2704
02:25:36,780 --> 02:25:38,080
I probably will just anger him.

2705
02:25:38,740 --> 02:25:40,920
That's fine, because I intend to escape if that happens.

2706
02:25:42,060 --> 02:25:44,900
You know, just throw a rock at someone, and if they get angry, you run.

2707
02:25:46,660 --> 02:25:47,460
Solid advice.

2708
02:25:52,300 --> 02:25:52,620
Okay.

2709
02:25:53,540 --> 02:25:54,280
Come on now.

2710
02:25:55,820 --> 02:25:56,120
Nice.

2711
