Ah, let's get rid of the chaotic polymorphine, I guess.

2714
02:26:13,180 --> 02:26:14,460
I don't know why I'm taking this.

2715
02:26:15,060 --> 02:26:16,280
I feel like it's got to be important.

2716
02:26:18,120 --> 02:26:18,380
You know?

2717
02:26:20,060 --> 02:26:21,200
Oh wait, am I using...

2718
02:26:22,880 --> 02:26:24,500
No, I'm going to use this a bit.

2719
02:26:24,500 --> 02:26:26,020
I like this one.

2720
02:26:26,440 --> 02:26:27,100
Not bad.

2721
02:26:28,420 --> 02:26:28,860
It's decent.

2722
02:26:30,940 --> 02:26:31,620
So what do we have here?

2723
02:26:32,240 --> 02:26:34,260
Burning trail and fireballs.

2724
02:26:35,300 --> 02:26:35,860
Firebolts.

2725
02:26:36,800 --> 02:26:37,620
It's a shuffle.

2726
02:26:39,580 --> 02:26:40,600
We don't like that.

2727
02:26:43,830 --> 02:26:46,750
But this is also... wait, this is a circle of thunder.

2728
02:26:48,990 --> 02:26:49,430
I don't know.

2729
02:26:50,010 --> 02:26:50,390
Leave it.

2730
02:26:52,650 --> 02:26:53,430
I don't want it!

2731
02:26:54,890 --> 02:26:56,610
Maybe someone else will want it.

2732
02:26:57,310 --> 02:26:57,560
Not me.

2733
02:26:59,130 --> 02:26:59,590
Flammoxium.

2734
02:27:09,990 --> 02:27:10,870
Guess I go down.

2735
02:27:13,590 --> 02:27:14,410
Ooh, a chest!

2736
02:27:16,830 --> 02:27:17,710
I wand!

2737
02:27:18,450 --> 02:27:20,370
Holy shit, there's a bunch of stuff on this one!

2738
02:27:22,670 --> 02:27:26,770
Energy sphere, bouncing burst, luminous drill with timer.

2739
02:27:27,010 --> 02:27:29,650
I think I had one of these before and I didn't quite understand it.

2740
02:27:30,770 --> 02:27:34,210
Sparkables, another luminous home-bringer teleport bolt.

2741
02:27:35,070 --> 02:27:36,070
A bunch of stuff!

2742
02:27:37,230 --> 02:27:39,370
I think I want it just because it's a bunch of stuff.

2743
02:27:41,410 --> 02:27:43,730
Um, maybe I replace this one.

2744
02:27:45,950 --> 02:27:47,230
Yeah, fuck it.

2745
02:27:47,770 --> 02:27:50,530
And then we use this one as our main damage dealer.

2746
02:27:51,750 --> 02:27:53,010
Yeah, I do like the arrow.

2747
02:27:54,870 --> 02:27:57,410
We can probably make something out of that wand later.

2748
02:27:57,410 --> 02:28:00,390
Or the spells within it.

2749
02:28:01,690 --> 02:28:02,950
Don't even dare, sir.

2750
02:28:03,730 --> 02:28:04,690
Come here.

2751
