Headshot!

2752
02:28:12,060 --> 02:28:14,560
Sometimes these guys die with one arrow, sometimes they don't.

2753
02:28:14,660 --> 02:28:15,200
I don't understand.

2754
02:28:16,300 --> 02:28:18,320
And it doesn't specify a crit, so that's not what happens.

2755
02:28:20,640 --> 02:28:23,180
Wait, fu- I'm confused.

2756
02:28:27,220 --> 02:28:27,380
Why?

2757
02:28:27,780 --> 02:28:29,100
Is there such a thing as headshot?

2758
02:28:29,240 --> 02:28:29,620
Hold on.

2759
02:28:32,680 --> 02:28:33,040
Shit!

2760
02:28:35,400 --> 02:28:37,220
My god, I can't hit anything.

2761
02:28:38,560 --> 02:28:40,160
See, I did five damage, then I did ten.

2762
02:28:43,340 --> 02:28:44,280
I don't understand.

2763
02:28:46,320 --> 02:28:47,540
Why is that happening?

2764
02:28:51,880 --> 02:28:53,780
Uh, okay, I'm gonna get in there.

2765
02:28:56,360 --> 02:28:56,620
Sweet.

2766
02:29:01,170 --> 02:29:01,650
Uh...

2767
02:29:01,650 --> 02:29:02,330
What does he have in his hand?

2768
02:29:03,750 --> 02:29:04,610
Oh, okay!

2769
02:29:08,560 --> 02:29:09,740
My dude is insane.

2770
02:29:14,480 --> 02:29:16,560
Has a lot of HP, too.

2771
02:29:18,680 --> 02:29:19,740
How are you not dead?

2772
02:29:23,540 --> 02:29:23,880
Good.

2773
02:29:28,760 --> 02:29:30,000
Oh, I almost got poisoned.

2774
02:29:32,700 --> 02:29:33,300
A bit risky.

2775
02:29:33,800 --> 02:29:34,600
