2776
02:29:37,920 --> 02:29:38,920
That's for you, sir.

2777
02:29:44,240 --> 02:29:45,200
Holy shit!

2778
02:29:47,160 --> 02:29:48,580
Ah, I- I- Dammit.

2779
02:29:49,760 --> 02:29:51,320
I, uh... forgot about that.

2780
02:29:53,100 --> 02:29:53,580
Whoops!

2781
02:29:56,720 --> 02:29:57,720
That was a bummer.

2782
02:29:58,740 --> 02:29:59,420
