2792
02:30:18,660 --> 02:30:22,380
Maybe I'll replace it with- Oh wait, this is the exact same wand.

2793
02:30:24,120 --> 02:30:24,640
Look!

2794
02:30:25,740 --> 02:30:27,100
The stats are identical!

2795
02:30:28,760 --> 02:30:29,340
The fuck?

2796
02:30:32,950 --> 02:30:33,810
That's crazy.

2797
02:30:36,590 --> 02:30:37,110
Um...

2798
02:30:37,110 --> 02:30:38,190
Maybe I don't want this.

2799
02:30:39,510 --> 02:30:41,090
I feel like that could fuck me up.

2800
